	(text "TL431B (TI, DBZ pinout 1=K 2=REF 3=A; TL432 differs!), ~1.6 mA via 470R. Divided and buffered\nto PH_REF = 1.25 V, which also drives the probe reference electrode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45ca05a7-99b1-4ffb-bb4e-ddbb667e6b63")
	)
	(text "ADS1115 on 3.3 V, I2C address 0x48 (JP 1-2, default) or 0x49 (2-3). ALERT/RDY unused.\nAll channels are read single-ended (aquaPi driver): AIN0 on-board pH, AIN1 pH reference\n(monitor, allows AIN0-AIN1 differential later), AIN2 external pH amplifier module, AIN3 general."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80539910-53a6-4bda-817d-86ef812d6f48")
	)
	(text "AIN2: external pH amplifier module (probe kit board), terminal +5V / SIG / GND. The module\noutput (about 2.5 V at pH 7) is filtered 10k/10u (1.6 Hz) and clamped to 0..3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 199.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "86d30cf6-a37d-4709-b51a-63412c67ebed")
	)
	(text "On-board pH front end: glass electrode on BNC centre, reference on BNC shell. The probe is\nbiased to PH_REF = 1.25 V (TL431 2.495 V / 2), so AIN0 reads 1.25 V +/- 59 mV/pH single-ended;\naquaPi's 2-point calibration removes the offset. BNC shell pads must stay on PH_REF, NOT GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b874bd4-6df7-405c-96dc-b88f1a3f8b58")
	)
	(text "AIN3: general 0..3.3 V input, 1k + 100n low-pass, clamped. Terminal: 3V3 / AIN3 / GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ac876719-cea6-41d7-b5d2-76165d7e552f")
	)
	(text "Probe load: TLV9062 input (0.5 pA typ) and the polystyrene (styroflex) filter cap across the probe;\nno ceramic cap or clamp on PH_BNC/PH_IN (leakage). Cap x electrode R (100M..1G): 0.2..2 s input filter;\nswap for 47p..6n8 as needed. Second 50 Hz filter after the buffer: 10k/10u, 1.6 Hz.\nLAYOUT: guard ring around PH_BNC, R45 and U6 pin 3, connected to PH_BUF; short traces; clean flux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bce061f1-1d9e-4bd6-aa94-ebe29ac94018")
	)
